  "scope": "Seventeen actual captured bodies, no generated output. Native oracle constructs exactly two live C++ derived inputs and repeats each of two field-value scenarios. Captured fixture only borrows input pointers, takes nonvirtual field reads and uses pointer/Boolean/base/member calls; no pointee construction, destruction or virtual invocation. Future generated proof must use separately labeled aligned layout bytes, without a C++ lifetime/vtable equivalence claim.",
  "findings": [
    "CellInput complete extent/alignment 56/8 and selected unsigned-byte enum-associated field 24 agree with native physical coordinates. Prefix offset 8/tail 32,40,48 are captured facts, not source layout inference.",
    "Pointer methods use the same natural 8/8 ordinary pointer type in this fixture; no distinct pointer-result alias waiver is exercised. Const pointer-object local initialization is an actual retained execution statement.",
    "Proxy complete 24/8 differs from occupied/NV partner 17/8. Only complete representation is used here; the occupied partner is not admitted by the baseline.",
    "Actual optimized direct empty-base offset 0 and differing indirect metadata are retained separately. No generated execution of the captured forward lvalue-adjust/address and reverse receiver cast is claimed.",
    "bfk_expect is captured by exact discriminant and signed64 signature with constant-zero hint and once-observable first argument. Native expect/guard/missing counters 4/4/1 and 25 events distinguish direct and no-guard base paths.",
    "Only executable declaration-only dependency is the recorded compiler builtin. Unused optional extern vtable metadata does not imply virtual/RTTI/provider execution. Actual DuckDB guard body/link/EH remains outside this fixture."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Native source is an independent oracle, never a provider or application fallback. No generated construction, lifetime/virtual/ownership/no-throw/native ABI claim.",
    "Short native runtime sampled RSS misses startup; waited high-water RSS is separate. All resource measurements cover their exact command phase, not a full translator workload.",
    "Product, Runtime and providers stay frozen at 16a07ae6b; typed method/view/intrinsic admission still requires the reviewed implementation and JIT/AOT execution."
  ]
